cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Team Science: An Examination of Factors Associated with Citation Metrics"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, preregistration materials, and manuscript source for a
  study of how co-authorship team size and team composition (gender,
  h-index, number of institutions and countries) are associated with
  citation metrics across disciplines, using Scopus metadata provided
  through Elsevier's International Center for the Study of Research (ICSR) Lab.
  The underlying dataset is not included; it is accessible through ICSR.
